              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nowangʼ boche duto kendo nowangʼ-gi ewi kendo mar misango mana kaka iwangʼo mo mar rombo mar lalruok, kendo jadolo nowangʼ bochego ewi misengini miwangʼo ni Jehova Nyasaye gi mach. Kamano e kaka jadolo nopwodh ketho mar ngʼatno kendo nowene richone.",
